Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我告诉父亲我害怕躲在衣柜里的东西时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I told dad I was scared of the thing in my closet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他直接给了我一把四五式手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me a.45.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他应该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was he supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时才9岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 9 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.77,0:00:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是学习使用武器以及溶银做子弹的年龄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weapon training and melting the silver into bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老哥 迪恩 我们是被当作战士养大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, dean, we were raised like warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,关紧门窗 拉上窗帘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the doors and windows, close the shades.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And most important …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,照看好萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out for sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法理解你对他的言听计从\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand the blind faith you have in the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是一个好儿子该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called being a good son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸会回来的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's gonna be here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会回来的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be here. promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他究竟去哪儿了 - 出差\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he, anyway? - on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是你离家不归的原因 - 我只是去上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that's why you ran away. - I was just going to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是爸爸说走了就别再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was dad who said if I was gonna go, I should stay gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.94,0:00:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥和我 我们都需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother and me … we needed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.91,0:00:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离我们而去 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walked away, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你丢下了我们 - 都住口 你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You walked away! - stop it, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你让我别再回来的 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who said, "don't come back, " dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是那个关上门的人 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who closed that door, not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝不是我希望你拥有的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is never the life that I wanted for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.15,0:01:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我相信如果可能 爸爸一定会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sure dad would have been here if he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真是个荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's such a slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,个人而言 我非常欣赏荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally, I'm very pro-slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.63,0:01:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可是让杰米·贾菲好好地受了次打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}She totally banged Jamie Jaffe, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全颠覆了他心目中女牛仔形象\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave him the reverse cowgirl and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒 你周末过得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Taylor. how was your weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.31,0:01:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没 没去参加牛仔竞技表演吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't… go to the rodeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的位子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这里是淑女地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. this is a skeev-free zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slut!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.39,0:01:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,荡妇 荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slut! slut!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,荡妇 荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slut! slut!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.64,0:01:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不必在意那些混蛋们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't listen to those jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.22,0:02:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感到抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你可怜 你个丑陋的肥婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you feel sorry for me, you fat, ugly pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我很丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.23,0:02:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的本意 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点也不丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才丑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再谈论这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经将经过都告诉警察和医生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already told the cops and the doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没人相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one believes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都觉得我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我的接受能力比大部分人强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm a little bit more open-minded than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱普丽尔 为什么跟警察说你被恶魔附身了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}April, why did you tell the police you were possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它对我来说很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It matters to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.91,0:04:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我攻击泰勒的时候 我就在那儿 意识清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I hurt Taylor, I was there, in my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却完全无法自控\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I couldn't control my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我眼睁睁地看着自己干得一切 就是没法阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could see what I was doing, but I couldn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:04:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本无须道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱普丽尔 有些同学跟警察说\N{\fnArial\fs30}April, some of the kids at school told the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.17,0:05:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和泰勒相处的不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you and Taylor didn't get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但我从没想过要杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, but I never wanted to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,事发当天 你有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the day this happened, did you…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happen to smell anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如臭鸡蛋或是硫磺的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like rotten eggs or… sulfur?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你有看到过黑烟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, did you notice any… black smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.06,0:05:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:05:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为她说的都是真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她说的来看更多的是精神层面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the way she talked about being there mentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是肉体上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not physically …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸多描述听起来和附身在我体内的恶魔很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of sounds like demonic possession to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有见到任何黑烟或是闻到硫磺味\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't see any black smoke or smell sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许根本就不是恶魔 有些孩子本身就很邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's not a demon. I mean, kids can be vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我们都在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, we're already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如就顺便去学校转悠看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well check out the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.87,0:06:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜鲁门高中 大麻的摇篮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truman high, home of the bombers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说啥呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前来这儿 就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we went there, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一百万年之前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a month a million years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回这儿为啥你这么兴奋呢 - 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you so jazzed to go back? - I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是觉得值得一查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think it's worth looking into.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们这次要扮什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, what's our cover?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局还是国土安全局\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI? homeland security?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不瑞士交换生如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swedish exchange students?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早有主意啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.95,0:06:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢啦 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,午饭带上了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}got your lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,课本 还有折叠刀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Books? butterfly knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都带了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经是我们今年的第三个学校了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the third school we've been to this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在才刚十一月\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's only november.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再当新生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just sick of always being the new kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.81,0:07:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有人找你麻烦 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone gives you any trouble, you let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 爸爸说过这次猎鬼最多两个礼拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. dad said this hunt will take him two weeks, tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他一回来我们就走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as he gets back, we're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再换个学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}To another school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.23,0:07:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please say hello to sam winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:08:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,同学们 欢迎我们的新同学 迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Class, say hello to our new student, dean winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.39,0:08:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 能跟大家介绍下你自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Is there anything you'd like to tell us about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去坐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟大伙介绍下自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything you'd like to tell us about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.73,0:08:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.88,0:08:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 找个位子坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. uh, grab a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, that's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你的书呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, where are your books?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need 'em, sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.47,0:08:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿呆不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna be here long enough anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 同学们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, gang…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,写作作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Essay assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.03,0:09:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊 为你们感到难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, my heart breaks for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫巴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次要写的是你们最难忘的家庭生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now, I want three pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求写满三张纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of your most memorable family experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别欺负他\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 我正破记录呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, I'm going for a record.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 别欺负他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "leave him alone."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那欺负你怎么样 小矮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to take his place…midget?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 还有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}O.K. Anybody for any qusetions?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那开始吧 祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get started. good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 你们将有幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}today, you will have the honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加有史以来最伟大的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of playing one of the greatest games ever invented.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.57,0:10:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个需要技巧 敏捷和智慧的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}A game of skill, agility, cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个只有一条简单规则的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}A game with one simple rule…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲避球\N{\fnArial\fs30}…dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯代教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, substitute coach Roth…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,布乔女士从没让我们玩过躲避球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. boudreaux never let us play dodge ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,布女士正在马萨诸塞州结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ms. b's in massachusetts getting married,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们现在来玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说这不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.30,0:10:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,去跑一圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a lap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.99,0:10:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始疯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩的开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以用哨子掌控他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whistle makes me their god.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 短裤不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. nice shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.73,0:11:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把整所学校彻底搜查了两遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been over the entire school twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.65,0:11:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没硫磺就没恶魔 没恶魔就没案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sulfur, no demon. no demon, no case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 可能我搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. maybe I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 看来是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it happens to the best of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.13,0:11:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就上路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we hit the road, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要等吃完午饭 今天有乔邋遢（一种只有一半的汉堡包）\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after lunch. it's sloppy-joe day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的漂亮 科比 得分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good hustle, colby! walk it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,再借我抄一下你的代数作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I need to copy your algebra homework again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.23,0:11:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是个愚蠢的脑残混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're a stupid, brain-dead dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用我的拳头捏断你的喉咙 小怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna shove my fist down your throat, you little freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那只拳头吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That fist? - yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,非暴力集会进行的怎样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the nonviolence assembly going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然把孩子的胳膊塞进搅拌机里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, shoving a kid's arm into a cuisinart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.07,0:12:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非健康的怒气发泄方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is not a "healthy display of anger"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有流质流出那孩子的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the kid had ectoplasm leaking out his ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一个气疯了的鬼魂干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which only comes from a seriously pissed-off spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是鬼魂附体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be ghost possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但那样还真少见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but that's pretty rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:12:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但却发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到他们足够愤怒的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they get angry enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.03,0:13:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能操纵人的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can take control of a person's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们是要对付这栋房子里的鬼魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, what, we got a ghost in the building?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但是它在哪 探测器找不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but where? I mean, there's no emf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许至少我们能知道它是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could find out who it is, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,查一下惨死在这里之类的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, check and see if somebody died bloody around here or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闯进校长办公室 找到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to break into the principal's office to get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有仅供参考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and fyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三个啦啦队员是合法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of the cheerleaders are legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜是哪三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess which ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.41,0:13:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,校园里只死过一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, there was only one death on campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,于98年自杀而亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a suicide back in '98.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫巴里·库克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kid named barry cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一楼的女厕所里割腕自尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slit his wrists in the first-floor girls' bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.69,0:13:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是女孩被马桶溺死的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right where the chick got swirleyed to death. exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 这只鬼专挑小人物下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? this ghost is possessing nerds?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后利用他们报复欺负他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And using them to go after bullies, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.21,0:13:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这像是巴里的订单么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, does that sound like barry's m.o.?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴里有过一段艰难时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barry had a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 萨姆 - 真是好学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, sam. - great school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,三年后 我就解脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three years, and I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去密歇根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to michigan state.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有全国最好的兽医学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got the best vet program in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢动物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们比人好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a lot nicer than people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tonight I'm thinking you, me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.97,0:14:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一桶奶油口味的爆米花\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bucket of popcorn, extra butter…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有情调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, kinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在放映厅看“我唾弃你的坟墓”\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the midnight screening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.01,0:14:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受你的午夜尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of "I spit on your grave" at the cinedome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.59,0:14:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一点前要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a curfew… at 11:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.89,0:14:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我晚回 家人会禁足我一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if I break it, my folks will ground me for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 家长 真恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, parents. terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的宵禁是几点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when's your curfew?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.01,0:15:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你爸妈允许你整晚都呆在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents just let you stay out all night, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.29,0:15:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸出差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's out of town on a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.89,0:15:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩我和我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just me and my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.04,0:15:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们在松树林里有个不错的窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we got a pretty sweet setup at the pines.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.01,0:15:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车旅馆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The motel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.68,0:15:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星电视 免费饮料 棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hbo, magic fingers, free ice … it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…i guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？我可以随心所欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I do whatever I want, whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,多棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.69,0:15:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想你爸爸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you miss your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.04,0:16:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo! sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你哥和阿曼达·海克琳吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your brother with amanda heckerling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他也是这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. he thinks so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正找你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.85,0:16:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想代替巴里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still want to take barry's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离开这 巴里 - 我去找老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of here, barry. - I'll go get a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,想走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和你打架 德克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna fight you, dirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不 你害怕了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? you chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up! get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来呀 站起来 - 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! get up! - hey, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.91,0:16:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜了 巴里·库克\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, barry cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.09,0:17:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴里曾是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barry was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.27,0:17:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚烧了他的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just burned his bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在安息了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's at peace now, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果爸爸让我们多呆一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if dad had let us stay just a little while longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我就能帮那个孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I could have helped the kid, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.18,0:17:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看过验尸官的报告了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read the coroner's report same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴里吃过目前所有的抗焦虑药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barry was on every anxiety drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.65,0:17:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有抗抑郁药\N{\fnArial\fs30}And antidepressant known to man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校对那个孩子来说就是地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}School was hell for that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.05,0:18:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的父母离异了 他只想离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}His parents had split up. he just wanted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很悲惨 但这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was tragic, but it's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,实话告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴我们离开了那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad we got out of that town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨那所学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hated that school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.51,0:18:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇到了那样的事 怎么还这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you say that after what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.92,0:18:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那家伙死定了 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That kid's dead. - dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他的心挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna rip his lungs out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.79,0:18:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没什么大不了 - 没什么大不了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not a big deal. - not a big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 看看你自己 如果爸爸在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, look at yourself. if dad was here …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.63,0:18:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.99,0:18:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一了结那家伙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as soon as I'm finished with that dick …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你可以自己把他大卸八块\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, you don't. you could have torn him apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不那么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我这次不想做怪物 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't want to be the freak for once, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.98,0:19:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,挨打就算正常了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So taking a beating … that's normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸那有消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any word from dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今早打电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,说至少还要一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he's going to be another week at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本不该在这呆这么长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't supposed to be here this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你还有阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you've got amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弟 她想让我见她父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, she wants me to meet her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不见父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't do parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特先生 能和你聊几句吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. winchester, can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在外面等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wait for you outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.43,0:19:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是关于打架 不是我开的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if this is about the fight, I didn't start it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.17,0:19:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是关于打架 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, it's not about the fight, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.40,0:20:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这个作业不是写小说 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this assignment was nonfiction, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 怀特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, mr. wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.91,0:20:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你和你家人去年夏天杀了个狼人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you and your family killed a werewolf last summer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要写这样的东西 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you write something like this, sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.56,0:20:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸一回来我们就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as my dad gets back, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你想 可以让我不及格\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can flunk me if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会给你不及格 我给你优秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not flunking you. I'm giving you an "a."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,先不说那个狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, aside from the werewolf,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是那样想你家人的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that really how you'd describe your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥真是个人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your brother is quite a character.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你爸爸 看起来也是被逼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your father … he seems, uh, driven.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 这很好 萨姆 真的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, it's good, sam. it's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,想过从事写作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever thought about pursuing writing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.62,0:20:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得从事家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go into the family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:20:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族事业？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family business?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.49,0:20:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我爸爸是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my dad's a m…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.26,0:21:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸是个机械工\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's a mechanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.10,0:21:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我也必须做机械工\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I have to be a mechanic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.03,0:21:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想从事家族事业吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to go in the family business, sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前没人这么问过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever asked me that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than anything, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想过界 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to overstep my bounds here, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.12,0:21:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必做你不想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you don't have to do anything you don't want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I mean, I know what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.46,0:21:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家是个医生世家 但我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come from a family of surgeons, and that wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know, I traded in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用钱和医生的声望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The money and prestige of being a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,换来现在你所看到的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all the glamour you see around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the point is…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 有几个重大抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may be three or four big choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.38,0:21:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,会决定一个人的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shape someone's whole life,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.71,0:21:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你需要成为那个作出决定的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need to be the one that makes them,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.69,0:21:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去是个很好的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem like a great kid, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:22:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,过你想过的生活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just live the life you want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回到这就是为了让你和老师谈心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came back here so you could talk to a teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.24,0:22:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,找你的授业恩师去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go have your Robin Williams.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.51,0:22:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,「哦 冠军 我的冠军」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"o captain! my captain!" moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.07,0:22:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:22:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我305室怎么走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell me how to find room 305?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.41,0:22:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. um…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,大厅尽头 第一个拐角右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head down the hall, take your first right,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.18,0:23:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,左手边第三个门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's the third door on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长高了 温切斯特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got tall, Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.43,0:23:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这会有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. This will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.43,0:23:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个鬼死定了 我要把它的心挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ghost is dead. I'm gonna rip its lungs out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.14,0:24:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.07,0:24:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,它知道我的名字 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It knew my name, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.04,0:24:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}My real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.08,0:24:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们烧了巴里的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We burned Barry's bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.51,0:24:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.88,0:24:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不是巴里 也许我们忽略了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe it wasn't Barry. Maybe we missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回头想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.63,0:24:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.40,0:24:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前怎么没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did we not see this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.33,0:24:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 Martha Dumptruck\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Martha Dumptruck,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.84,0:24:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货的报复 还有hello kitty\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge of the nerds, and hello kitty …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.70,0:24:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们乘坐同一辆巴士\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all rode the same bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许那巴士闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so maybe the bus is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.04,0:24:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就能解释为什么学校里没有电磁干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that would explain why there's no emf at the school,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.84,0:24:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但解释不了袭击事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not the attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.38,0:24:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂应该被束缚在他们死的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, ghosts are tied to the places that they haunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.81,0:24:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能随便跑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't just bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.75,0:24:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非这个鬼能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless this one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.32,0:24:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 有些关于鬼附身的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, there's lore about spirits possessing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.52,0:24:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以支配人四下走动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And riding them for miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.79,0:24:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们离开宿主的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then whenever they leave the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.56,0:24:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就会回到自己的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're bungeed back to their usual haunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.56,0:24:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但离开宿主之前 他们想去哪就去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until then, the ghosts can go wherever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.93,0:25:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那鬼魂附在巴士上一个孩子身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a spook just grabs a kid on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.07,0:25:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后大摇大摆走进杜鲁门高中？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And walks right into Truman?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.63,0:25:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.30,0:25:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶鬼也有创意 真是绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts getting creative … well, that's super.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.78,0:25:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然是个是非之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely ain't clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.41,0:25:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这来 小鬼头…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, ghosty, ghosty, ghosty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.72,0:25:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来吧 出来吧 不管你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out, come out, wherever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.55,0:25:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.98,0:25:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没人死在这辆巴士上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one ever died on this bus,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.39,0:25:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也没什么尸骨藏在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not like there's a body hidden in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.05,0:25:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但皮肤 头发 肉刺什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but a flap of skin, a hair, I mean, hell, a hangnail,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.92,0:25:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有什么东西把鬼束缚在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's got to be tying the ghost to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.49,0:25:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.16,0:25:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.78,0:25:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到个新的驾驶执照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a new driving permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.62,0:25:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,两周前发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Issued two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.95,0:25:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在第一次袭击之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just before the first attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.42,0:25:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.72,0:26:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴士司机的名字叫老德克 Mcgregor\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name of the bus driver is Dirk Mcgregor Sr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.16,0:26:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,北中央大街39号\N{\fnArial\fs30}39 north central avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.76,0:26:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mcgregor？-嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mcgregor? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.70,0:26:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.70,0:26:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识他儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.30,0:26:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是认识这学校的每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know everybody at this school?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.91,0:26:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着路 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to watch where you're going, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.88,0:26:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别惹他 德克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him alone, Dirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.69,0:26:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不长记性是吧 小矮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never learn, do you, midget?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.12,0:26:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 巴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the bus, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.87,0:26:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你害怕了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter? You scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.50,0:26:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.21,0:26:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我会对你手下留情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go easy on you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.24,0:26:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 废人切斯特 看看你有什么本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, lose-chester. Let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.34,0:26:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.01,0:26:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.71,0:27:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没那么强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.24,0:27:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.88,0:27:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dirk the jerk."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.65,0:27:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dirk the jerk!"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.59,0:27:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和德克是朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you were friends with Dirk?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.26,0:27:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生 高中时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.83,0:27:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得德克在高中有那么多朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recall Dirk having many friends at Truman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.97,0:27:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, sit. sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.70,0:27:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候…德克什么时候过世的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did, uh … when did Dirk pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.77,0:27:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他18岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.01,0:27:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.21,0:28:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 酗酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there was, first, drinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.18,0:28:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再就是嗑药 太多的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then drugs, and then too many drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.51,0:28:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他就从我生命里消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he just slipped through my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.25,0:28:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.16,0:28:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该预见到这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have seen it coming, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.36,0:28:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克 他…他有他的烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dirk, he, uh … well, he had his troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.66,0:28:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of troubles?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.20,0:28:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,上学对德克是件难事\N{\fnArial\fs30}School was never easy for Dirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.83,0:28:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并没有多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't have much money,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.34,0:28:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 孩子 也可以是很残忍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, you know, kids … they can be cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.97,0:28:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总找他的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They picked on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.27,0:28:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找他的麻烦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They picked on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.74,0:28:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.58,0:28:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说他又穷又脏又蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called him poor and dirty and stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.75,0:28:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还给他起了外号\N{\fnArial\fs30}They even had a nickname for him …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.39,0:28:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dirk the jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.59,0:28:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他母亲出事之后 他就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after what happened to his mother, he …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.66,0:28:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他母亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}His mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.99,0:28:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 简 我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Jane, my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克13岁的时候她过世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died when Dirk was 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.43,0:28:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.70,0:28:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忙于三份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was working three jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.74,0:29:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以把照顾她的责任全留给了德克\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it fell to Dirk to take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.84,0:29:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was a great kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.07,0:29:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他保证简得到治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made sure Jane got her medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.71,0:29:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮她 为她善后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped her, cleaned up after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.11,0:29:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 当你看着一个人慢慢死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, you … you watch somebody die slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.78,0:29:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,日渐消瘦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waste away to nothing…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.65,0:29:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会对人有影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does things to a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.42,0:29:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.43,0:29:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他妈妈的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know about his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.93,0:29:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从不谈她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He … he wouldn't talk about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.33,0:29:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我也不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.64,0:29:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心里积压了太多的怨气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of anger in that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.37,0:29:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.91,0:29:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦格雷戈先生 我们想凭吊一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'd really like to pay our respects, Mr.Mcgregor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.42,0:29:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我们德克葬在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you mind telling us where dirk is buried?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.42,0:29:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是土葬的 我把他火化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he wasn't. I had him cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.06,0:29:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个身体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.80,0:30:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保存了他的一绺头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I kept a lock of his hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.37,0:30:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 那挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's … that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.87,0:30:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you keep that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.07,0:30:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车上 夹在圣经里\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my bus, in my bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.00,0:30:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你今晚替班 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for subbing tonight, eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.57,0:30:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的荣幸 教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pleasure, coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.97,0:30:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 开慢点行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, you want to ease up on the pedal, there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.81,0:31:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开得稳着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it all under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.25,0:31:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.12,0:31:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.55,0:31:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dirk!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.48,0:31:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.32,0:31:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样 向我开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do, shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.95,0:31:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没这个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.82,0:31:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳子浸过盐水 德克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That rope is soaked in salt water, dirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.93,0:31:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪也别想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.46,0:31:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都呆在原地 你们会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody stay where you are. you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.37,0:32:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是体育老师吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you the p.e. teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.80,0:32:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我就像“少年龙虎队”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really. I'm like "21 jump street."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.67,0:32:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,司机贩毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bus driver sells pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.24,0:32:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.39,0:32:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.76,0:32:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.86,0:32:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way you'll ever find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.49,0:32:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.46,0:32:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.50,0:32:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个恶霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still a bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.50,0:32:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你们这些运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you jocks…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.37,0:32:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些受欢迎的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You popular kids…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.67,0:32:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们总认为自己高人一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always thought you were better than everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.84,0:32:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们眼里 我只是德克蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to you, I was just dirk the jerk, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.18,0:32:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一报还一报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you evil sons of bitches are gonna get what's coming to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.02,0:32:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是恶魔 德克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not evil, dirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.59,0:32:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And neither were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.09,0:32:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我见过真正的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. I've seen real evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.03,0:33:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是害怕而且痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were scared and miserable,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.90,0:33:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后跟彼此 跟所有人都过不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we took it out on each other …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.60,0:33:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来转移这种情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us and everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.60,0:33:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是高中\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.04,0:33:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些都过去了 现在好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you suffer through that, and it gets better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.18,0:33:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾你无法看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just sorry you didn't get a chance to see that…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.08,0:33:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和巴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You or barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.32,0:33:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么能让我感到一丝好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is gonna get better for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.92,0:33:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.29,0:33:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 找头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! find the hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.70,0:34:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 事情并非看上去那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, this isn't what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.40,0:34:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little help?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.94,0:34:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给你一个大满怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's giving you the full cowgirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.82,0:35:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等5分钟 杰里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five more minutes, jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.86,0:35:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.66,0:35:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖茨堡演说 1863年 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gettysburg address, 1863, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.87,0:35:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,下节课历史测验 我们正在学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}History test next period. we're studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.04,0:35:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样宝贝 她对我什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby. she means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.08,0:35:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.61,0:35:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没生气 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not mad, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.88,0:35:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为 或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.65,0:35:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的鬼扯 你的调皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underneath your whole "i could give a crap, " bad-boy thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.59,0:35:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你的表面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there was something more going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.32,0:35:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你和你兄弟在一起时那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, like the way you are with your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.70,0:36:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.20,0:36:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你费尽心思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you spend so much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.17,0:36:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让别人相信你很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to convince people that you're cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.27,0:36:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是作秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's just an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.41,0:36:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不过是个悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know that you're just a sad…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.91,0:36:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤独的孩子而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonely little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.61,0:36:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你感到难过 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I feel sorry for you, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.21,0:36:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我感到难过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel sorry for me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.95,0:36:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为我感到难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't feel sorry for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.95,0:36:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.79,0:36:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拯救生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.12,0:36:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是英雄 英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a hero. a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.83,0:36:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.17,0:36:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.24,0:37:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.54,0:37:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.61,0:37:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真等不及离开这鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.54,0:37:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方太烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.82,0:37:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.23,0:38:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, mr. wyatt?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.86,0:38:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.04,0:38:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不记得我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably don't remember me,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.90,0:38:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, but my name is sam winchester,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.64,0:38:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想来谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.04,0:38:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.88,0:38:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前是这的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a student here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.65,0:38:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给过我一些建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you gave me some advice once.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.98,0:38:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特 对 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester, right. right. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.29,0:38:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你写了那个恐怖故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh … you wrote that horror story.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.42,0:38:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我写过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.09,0:38:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直是个长篇恐怖故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's kind of all been one long horror story.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.16,0:38:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.53,0:38:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么建议？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what was this advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.77,0:38:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以后可能需要剽窃一下自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might need to plagiarize myself down the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.21,0:38:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我说 我不必加入家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me that I didn't have to go into the family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.14,0:39:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我应该遵从自己的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I should make my own choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.11,0:39:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后你开始做自己喜爱的事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. so you've managed to do your own thing, then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.68,0:39:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 做了段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, for a while, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.48,0:39:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 我去念了大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think I went to college because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.06,0:39:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 人总会长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, people grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.43,0:39:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.29,0:39:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.40,0:39:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.90,0:39:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没人像你这么关心过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took an interest in me when no one else did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.54,0:39:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很重要 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That matters, so thanks you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.61,0:39:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, the only thing that really matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.88,0:39:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感到开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.75,0:39:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开心吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you happy, sam?
